OL,3,GNEWSADeputy leader says devolution to
OL,4,Abenefit Cornwall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy leader of the Labour party
OL,7,Fhas said Cornwall would be a "great
OL,8,Fbeneficiary" of upcoming devolution
OL,9,Fplans.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Lucy Powell was questioned
OL,12,Fby a number of BBC local radio stations
OL,13,Facross the country on various topics.
OL,15,FEarlier this month Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham said the government would work
OL,17,Fwith Cornwall Council and its six MPs
OL,18,Fon a devolution deal "with or without
OL,19,Fan elected mayor".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
