OL,3,GNEWSADeputy leader says devolution to
OL,4,Abenefit Cornwall
OL,5,
OL,6,FPowell said there is "lots and lots of
OL,7,Factivity and conversations going on"
OL,8,Fand the government had "been really
OL,9,Fclear that that doesn't need to happen
OL,10,Fby having a mayor anymore".
